#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kview; Options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:603
#, no-c-format
msgid "Viewer"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:605
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the configuration for the part of &kview; that can be reused by other "
"applications (meaning that the settings will also affect the &kview; part that "
"gets embedded into &konqueror; or other applications)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kview; viewer configuration dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:613
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kview; viewer configuration dialog</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:618
#, no-c-format
msgid "General configuration options for KViewCanvas"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:620
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use smooth scaling (high quality but slower)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:623
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As the option suggests, use a very high quality but relatively slow method of "
"scaling images."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keep aspect ratio"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:630
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is checked &kview; will always try to keep the aspect ratio. That means "
"if the width is scaled with a factor x, the height is scaled with the same "
"factor."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:637
#, no-c-format
msgid "Center image"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:639
#, no-c-format
msgid "If checked, the opened image will be displayed centered to the &kview; window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:645
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background Color"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:647
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens a normal &kde; color picker dialog, where you can choose the background "
"color for the image"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimum width:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:655
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The width of the image shown will not get smaller than the size you enter here. "
"A value of 10 would cause a 1x1 image to be stretched horizontally by a factor "
"of 10."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:662
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum width:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:664
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The width of the image shown will not get bigger than the size you enter here. "
"A value of 100 would cause a 1000x1000 image to be compressed horizontally by a "
"factor of 0.1."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimum height:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:673
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The height of the image shown will not get smaller than the size you enter "
"here. A value of 10 would cause a 1x1 image to be stretched vertically by a "
"factor of 10."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum height:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:682
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The height of the image shown will not get bigger than the size you enter here. "
"A value of 100 would cause a 1000x1000 image to be compressed vertically by a "
"factor of 0.1."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:689
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose which blend effects should be used:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:691
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every effect selected may be used to create a transition effect between the "
"images. If you select multiple effects they will be chosen randomly."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:700
#, no-c-format
msgid "Chooose and Configure Your Plugins"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:702
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browser"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:704
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can enable/disable use of the browser &kview; plugin, which enables "
"you to browse through all the images in the current folder."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:713 index.docbook:728
#, no-c-format
msgid "Application"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:715
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set options that are special for the &kview; application when "
"running stand-alone. What you change in here will not affect other "
"applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:720
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kview; application configuration dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:723
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kview; application configuration dialog</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:730
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resizing"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:731
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option determines if the window and/or the image will be resized after "
"loading a new picture into &kview;. With <guilabel>Only resize window</guilabel> "
"enabled, the &kview; window will be resized so that it snuggly fits around the "
"loaded image. Notice that this can reduce the main window almost to a vertical "
"arrangement of menu entries if you load a small button pixmap (you can resize "
"the window afterwards in the usual way, of course). If your image is pretty "
"large (in terms of pixels), sometimes the &kview; window is resized in such a "
"way that the caption bar completely moves off your screen. Similarly, <guilabel>"
"Resize image to fit window</guilabel> resizes the image to fit into the &kview; "
"workspace (keeping its aspect ratio intact). And with <guilabel>"
"Don't resize anything</guilabel> as your choice, both &kview; and your image "
"keep their size. With <guilabel>Best fit</guilabel> &kview; will resize the "
"window to fit the image. The image will never be scaled up but if it is too "
"large for the screen the image will be scaled down."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:750
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:752
#, no-c-format
msgid "Effects"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:754
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provides some image effects (and adds an <guimenu>Effects</guimenu> "
"to the menubar to give you access to them)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:760
#, no-c-format
msgid "Presenter"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:762
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creates an image list and enables you to create a slideshow."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanner"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:769
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adds <guimenu>Scan Image...</guimenu> to the <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> "
"menu to open images from your scanner into &kview;."
msgstr ""

