#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:816
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since &kview; is part of the &kde; desktop you need a working &kde; "
"installation to use it. However, some additional libraries are needed by "
"&kview; to use the various graphics file formats. For example, to handle the "
"<acronym>PNG</acronym> format &kview; needs the corresponding library libpng. "
"&kview; uses the libraries that are registered by kdelibs/kimgio."
msgstr ""

